    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 45:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rabbigu wuxuu ku leeyahay kan uu subkaday oo ah Kuuros, oo uu gacantiisa midig hayay inuu hortiisa quruumo ku hoosaysiiyo, oo uu boqorro dhexdooda guntiga ka furo, inuu hortiisa albaabbada ka furo, albaabbadaasna aanay mar dambe xidhmin: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.45.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.45.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 45:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anigu waan ku hor socon doonaa, oo meelaha sarsarena waan simi doonaa, waanan kala burburin doonaa albaabbada naxaasta ah, oo qataarrada birta ahna waan kala googooyn doonaa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.45.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.45.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 45:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "oo waxaan ku siin doonaa khasnadaha gudcurka iyo maal qarsoon oo meelo sir ah ku jira, inaad ogaatid inaan ahay Rabbiga ah Ilaaha reer binu Israa'iil oo magacaa kuugu yeedha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.45.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.45.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 45:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Addoonkaygii Yacquub oo ah Israa'iilkii aan doortay daraaddiis ayaan magacaa kuugu yeedhay, waanan ku magacaabay in kastoo aadan i aqoon. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.45.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.45.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 45:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waxaan ahay Rabbiga, oo mid kale ma jiro, aniga mooyaane Ilaah kale ma jiro. Anigaa guntiga kuu xidhay in kastoo aadan i aqoon, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.45.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.45.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 45:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "in qorrax ka soo bax iyo galbeedba laga ogaado inaan aniga mooyaane mid kale jirin. Anigaa Rabbiga ah, mid kalena ma jiro. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.45.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.45.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 45:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iftiinka anigaa sameeya, oo masiibadana anigaa abuura. Anigoo Rabbiga ah ayaa waxyaalahan oo dhan sameeya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.45.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.45.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 45:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.45.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.45.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 45:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Samooyinkow, xagga sare ka soo tiftifqa, oo daruuruhuna xaqnimo ha soo shubeen, dhulkuna ha furmo, oo badbaadada iyo xaqnimaduna ha isla soo wada baxaan. Aniga Rabbiga ah ayaa uumay.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.45.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.45.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 45:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.45.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.45.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 45:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waxaa iska hoogay ka Uumihiisa la dirira! Wuxuu la mid yahay dheri jabkiis oo ka mid ah jajabka dhulka! Dhoobadu miyey kan sameeya ku tidhaahdaa, War maxaad samaynaysaa? Amase shuqulkaaguu miyuu yidhaahdaa, Gacmo ma leh? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.45.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.45.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 45:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waxaa iska hoogay kii aabbe ku yidhaahda, War maxaad dhalaysaa? Amase naag ku yidhaahda, Na maxaad ku foolanaysaa? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.45.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.45.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 45:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rabbiga ah Kan Quduuska ah ee reer binu Israa'iil, oo ah Uumihiisu wuxuu leeyahay, Waxyaalaha iman doona ma i weyddiinaysaan, oo wax ku saabsan wiilashayda, iyo shuqulka gacmahayga ma igu amraysaan? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.45.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.45.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 45:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dhulka anigaa abuuray, oo dad baan ku dul uumay. Aniga qudhayda ayaa samooyinka gacmahayga ku kala bixiyey, oo ciidankooda oo dhanna anigaa amray. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.45.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.45.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 45:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rabbiga ciidammadu wuxuu leeyahay, Boqor Kuuros ayaan xaqnimo ku sara kiciyey, oo jidadkiisa oo dhanna waan toosin doonaa. Magaaladayduu dhisi doonaa, oo maxaabiistaydana wuu sii dayn doonaa, mana aha iib aawadiis amase laaluush aawadiis toona.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.45.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.45.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 45:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.45.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.45.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 45:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rabbigu wuxuu leeyahay, Hawsha Masar, iyo baayacmushtariga Itoobiya, iyo reer Saabaa'iim oo ah dad sarajoog dheer idinkay idiin soo gudbi doonaan, oo kuwiinnay ahaan doonaan. Iyagu way idin daba socon doonaan, oo waxay idiin soo gudbi doonaan iyagoo silsiladaysan, oo way idiin sujuudi doonaan, wayna idin baryi doonaan, iyagoo leh, Sida xaqiiqada ah Ilaah dhexdiinnu jiraa, oo mid kalena ma jiro, oo isaga mooyaane Ilaah kale ma jiro. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.45.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.45.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 45:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ilaaha reer binu Israa'iil oo ah Badbaadiyahow, sida runta ah waxaad tahay Ilaah isqariya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.45.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.45.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 45:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iyagu dhammaantood way ceeboobi doonaan oo giddigoodna way sharaf jabi doonaan, oo kuwa sanamyo sameeya oo dhammu way wada qasmi doonaan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.45.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.45.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 45:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Laakiinse Rabbigu wuxuu reer binu Israa'iil ku badbaadin doonaa badbaado daa'im ah, oo idinku weligiin iyo weligiinba ma aad ceeboobi doontaan, mana aad sharaf jabi doontaan.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.45.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.45.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 45:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.45.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.45.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 45:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waayo, Rabbiga samooyinka uumay oo ah Ilaaha dhulka uumay, oo sameeyey, oo dhisay, oo aan si aan waxba tarayn u uumin, laakiinse u uumay in la degganaado wuxuu leeyahay, Anigaa Rabbiga ah mid kalena ma jiro. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.45.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.45.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 45:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anigu kuma hadlin qarsoodi iyo meel gudcur ah oo dhulka ka mid ah. Farcanka Yacquub kuma odhan, Si aan waxba tarin ii doondoona. Aniga Rabbiga ahu waxaan ku hadlaa xaqnimo, oo waxaan sheegaa waxyaalo qumman. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.45.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.45.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 45:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuwiinna quruumaha ka baxsadayow, soo shira, oo dhammaantiin kaalaya, kulligiin soo wada dhowaada. Kuwa sanamyadooda qoriga ah sita oo ilaah aan waxba badbaadin karin barya aqoon ma leh. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.45.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.45.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 45:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sheega oo soo saara, iyagu ha isla wada tashadeen. Bal yaa waxyaalahan waa hore muujiyey? Oo bal yaa wakhti hore sii sheegay? Sow ma aha aniga Rabbiga ah? Oo aniga mooyaane Ilaah kale ma jiro. Waxaan ahay Ilaah xaq iyo Badbaadiye ah, oo aniga mooyaane mid kale ma jiro. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.45.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.45.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 45:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dhulka darafyadiisa oo dhammow, i soo eega, oo kulligiin badbaada, waayo, anigaa Ilaah ah, oo aniga mooyaane mid kale ma jiro. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.45.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.45.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 45:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waxaan ku dhaartay nafsaddayda, oo eray baa afkayga xaqnimo uga baxay, soona noqon maayo, waxaana weeye, Jilib waluba anuu ii sujuudi doonaa, carrab walubana waa igu dhaaran doonaa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.45.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.45.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 45:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waxaa laygu odhan doonaa, Rabbiga uun ayaa xaqnimo iyo xoogba leh. Isagaa loo iman doonaa, oo kuwii isaga u cadhaysnaa oo dhammuna way wada ceeboobi doonaan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.45.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.45.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 45:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Farcanka Israa'iil oo dhammu Rabbiga bay xaq ku noqon doonaan, wayna faani doonaan.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.45.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.45.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
